# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile copies. Git-ignored is not Docker-ignored.
.git/
.github/
infra/
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/*.tfplan
**/.terraform/
.venv/
**/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
docs/
tests/
scripts/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
release/

# Internal design material never leaves this machine.
SixDegrees_Design.md
